<title>USA: American Precision to buy Portescap SA.</title>
<headline>American Precision to buy Portescap SA.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Precision Industries Inc said Friday it has signed a contract to buy privately held Inter Scan Holding Ltd's Portscap SA for about $26 million.</p>
<p>American Precision said the previously reported purchase is payable in shares of preferred stock, convertible into API common stock at $17 per share for approximately 1,525,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company said Portscap, a manufacturer of micro-motors and other precision motion control products, has annual sales of about $60 million.</p>
</text>
